OpenBB: JODI (Joint Organisations Data Initiative) data extension.

The openbb-jodi package is a data provider extension for the OpenBB
Platform. It implements data pipelines and normalized data models that
connect directly to the Joint Organisations Data Initiative (JODI) Oil
and Gas World Databases.

Features include:
- Normalized access to JODI monthly petroleum and natural gas data.
- Structured retrieval of country-level production, trade, and stocks.
- Integration with the obb.jodi namespace inside the OpenBB framework.
- Zero-configuration data fetching requiring no external API keys.
